#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:5
#: b89fdf9a89f141f88fde51428d154109
msgid "UARTs and the Console"
msgstr "UART 与控制台"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:7
#: 82d1834f5e9d490fa5223cd6754e96a2
msgid ""
"A lot of components in ArduPilot rely on UARTs. They are used for debug "
"output, telemetry, GPS modules, and more. Understanding how to talk to "
"the UARTs via the HAL will help you understand a lot of ArduPilot code."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的许多组件都依赖 UART。它们用于调试输出、数传、GPS 模块等。了解如何通过 HAL 与 UART 通信将有助于理解大量"
" ArduPilot 代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:12
#: f8346062e67c487390940254ba2e3d41
msgid "The 8 UARTs"
msgstr "8 个 UART"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:14
#: f5e17924f6104f7180451a9869b91584
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot HAL currently defines 8 UARTs. The HAL itself does not "
"define any particular roles for these UARTs, but the other parts of "
"ArduPilot assume they will be assigned particular functions. The command-"
"line options for using with sim_vehicle.py the serial port should be "
"preceded by :code:`-A` to pass along to the vehicle binary. Make sure to "
"include the :code:`uart` protocol. Specifying a baudrate is not required,"
" but is more consistent. For example, :code:`sim_vehicle.py --console "
"--map -A --serial5=uart:/dev/ttyS15:115200`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot HAL 目前定义了 8 个 UART。HAL 本身不为这些 UART 定义特定角色，但 ArduPilot "
"的其他部分假设它们将被分配特定功能。在 sim_vehicle.py 中使用串口时，命令行选项应在前面加上 :code:`-A` "
"以传递给飞行器二进制文件。请确保包含 :code:`uart` "
"协议。波特率不是必须指定的，但指定会更一致。例如：:code:`sim_vehicle.py --console --map -A "
"--serial5=uart:/dev/ttyS15:115200`。"

