"Hardware flow control on SITL UART connections is configured via the "
":ref:`BRD_SERn_RTSCTS<BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` parameter, the same as on ChibiOS"
" targets. The old ``--rtscts`` command-line flag has been removed."
