#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:85
#: 1e16e276e97e49e6872ca4f5a413da43
msgid ""
"Values: **0** = disabled (SITL default), **1** = enabled, **2** = auto-"
"detect. Auto-detect monitors CTS activity over a 500 ms window and "
"enables or disables flow control accordingly. Flow control only applies "
"to physical UART connections (i.e., FTDI/CP210x); TCP/UDP connections "
"ignore it. For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:95
#: f091cd4356ee4e3982723e7484dfc38b
msgid "Debug console"
msgstr "调试控制台"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:97
#: 7de18242b3f048a9a3cb1852a06c8294
msgid ""
"Historically, In addition to the basic 5 UARTs there was an additional "
"debug console available on some platforms. Recently debug console is "
"directed to USB. On SITL, debug is directed to a terminal, while USB is "
"directed to port 5760 by default."
msgstr ""
"历史上，除了基本的 5 个 UART 之外，某些平台还提供了额外的调试控制台。最近调试控制台已改为输出到 USB。在 SITL (软件在环仿真) "
"中，调试输出到终端，而 USB 默认输出到端口 5760。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:101
#: b8070db08ed5470c9b7ca343490dfb8b
msgid ""
"If you have a board that does have HAL_OS_POSIX_IO set (check that in "
"`AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__)"
" then try adding some :code:`::printf()` and other stdio functions to the"
" UART_test sketch."
msgstr ""
"如果你的板子设置了 HAL_OS_POSIX_IO（在 `AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__"
" 中确认），可以试着往 UART_test 程序里加一些 :code:`::printf()` 及其他 stdio 函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:107
#: 0842026982854b7a844e08b7bb745d6a
msgid ""
"If :code:`::printf` doesn't work for you, it may be that your particular "
"file (e.g. a library) does not have :code:`#include <stdio.h>` at the top"
" of it, just add it. :-)"
msgstr ""
"如果 :code:`::printf` 不起作用，可能是你的文件（例如某个库）顶部没有 :code:`#include "
"<stdio.h>`，添加它即可。:-)"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-uarts-and-the-console.rst:109
#: fc88324b303045969d4faae1919bdee1
msgid "You can also use hal.console->printf() to specify USB port."
msgstr "也可以使用 hal.console->printf() 来指定 USB 端口输出。"

